<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial">{!Contact.FirstName},</font>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div><font face="arial">On behalf of our advising team, congratulations on your acceptance to Arizona State University and welcome to the T. Denny Sanford School of Social &amp; Family Dynamics! We provide academic advising for ASU Online students in the Sociology &amp; Family/Human Development programs.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Now that you have been admitted, we would like to encourage you to schedule an advising appointment with us. &nbsp;You can click on the following link to access our online scheduling system:</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/advsched/?acad_org=CSOCFAM" target="_blank">Schedule An Advising Appointment</a></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">In preparation for your appointment, please access your&nbsp;</font><a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/dars4webstudent" target="_blank">DARS</a><font face="arial">&nbsp;(Degree Audit&nbsp;Report) which shows your remaining degree requirements and watch this video on&nbsp;</font><a href="https://vimeo.com/119471478" target="_blank">Understanding DARS</a><font face="arial">. *Please note that the evaluation of your transfer work may be&nbsp;still be in progress and that this evaluation process can take a few weeks. If you notice the below message in your DARS (Degree Audit Report), your evaluation is not complete.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><img src="https://asu--c.na14.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=015d0000008WAul&amp;oid=00Dd0000000hLoc" border="0" align="left" alt=""><br></font></div><div><br></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">If you see this message, we would recommend allowing for a little more time before scheduling your advising appointment. &nbsp;Once that big red X disappears, your evaluation is complete and we can more fully review your transfer work and outstanding requirements for your degree with you.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">We look forward to working with you as you begin your academic journey here at Arizona State.</font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r3" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r3" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Sincerely,</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Name}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Title}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Phone}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Sanford Online Advising Team</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" size="1" color="#cccccc">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
